# SOST operator seeds — copy to <datadir>/seeds.txt (next to chain.json).
# One bootstrap seed per line: "host" (default port 19333) or "host:port".
# Lines starting with # are ignored. Max 64 entries.
# Lets you add INDEPENDENT bootstrap sources (other operators / domains) WITHOUT
# recompiling the node. Tried before the built-in sostcore.com seeds.
#
# examples:
# seed.someoneelse.example
# 203.0.113.42:19333
# node.community-sost.org
